WEBVTT

00:14:29.389 --> 00:14:32.423
Oklahomans leaving for California

00:14:32.423 --> 00:14:34.866
in large numbers for a better future.

00:14:34.866 --> 00:14:36.655
When we look at the demographic shifts

00:14:36.655 --> 00:14:37.815
of people coming from the west,

00:14:37.815 --> 00:14:39.443
it appears that what we're seeing now

00:14:39.443 --> 00:14:42.291
is the wrath of grapes.

00:14:42.291 --> 00:14:44.104
(Laughter)

00:14:44.104 --> 00:14:47.169
(Applause)

00:14:47.169 --> 00:14:51.714
The grandchildren are coming home.

00:14:51.714 --> 00:14:53.502
You've been a great audience and very attentive.

00:14:53.502 --> 00:14:55.953
Thank you very much for having me here.

00:14:55.953 --> 00:14:58.496
(Applause)